                              >>> NOTES <<<

     NUM3 - +500.000 EP
     This is the first time I'm using the 'pointer technique', I hope
     it works well for everyone.

     NUM4 - Easy Kills / Chaos Mode
     It's not always a good idea to keep this cheat activated. While
     testing I noticed that some enemys are dead before the event to
     kill them even started, this will kinda lock you.
     But it's kinda fun to roam through the city while this cheat
     is activated.

     NUM5 - Disable Attention Meter
     There are some scripted events that will trigger the attention
     meter.

     NUM7 - Disable Timers
     It could be possitble that deactivating the timer have some
     unwanted side effects. I would recommend to only activate this
     cheat when really needed (mission timers / events).



